  abilityId: 2820558
  abilityName: Arctic Calamity
  abilityDesc: 22 combo Water attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining HP),
    damage taken fills BB gauge for 4 turns, fully restores HP for 4 turns, boosts
    Atk, Def, Rec and critical rate for 4 turns, boosts Atk relative to Def for 3
    turns & adds Water barrier
